WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.480
We all have that one friend, we just can’t
take anywhere with us without a little explanation

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:06.160
and a whole lot of embarrassment.

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:11.502
Nobody expected what would happen when the
SCP Foundation cross-tested SCP-682, the Hard

00:00:11.502 --> 00:00:17.200
to Destroy Reptile, with SCP-082, a giant,
aggressive humanoid called Fernand the Cannibal.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:21.920
When they presented Fernand with a tissue
sample of 682, he said, “Oh, splendid!

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:23.440
My friend lives!”

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:27.520
When he entered the containment chamber, 682
immediately attempted to flee from him, despite

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:32.640
Fernand claiming they were friends who went
way back - And, in fact, 682 had once been

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:34.000
his loyal steed.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.640
After extended fighting, Fernand began to
ride 682, an experience the reptile found

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:40.160
supremely humiliating.

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:45.920
Once 082 left, the giant was delighted, and
SCP-682 said something about him that we can’t

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:48.880
repeat if we want to keep monetization on
this video.

